This component uses `useSelector` to access the cart items from the Redux store, and `useDispatch` to dispatch actions when adding or removing items. The `getTotalPrice` function calculates the sum of all item prices. When the cart is empty, it shows a friendly message, otherwise it displays a list of items with remove buttons and a total price.

